    <briefdescription>
<para>A wrapper that binds an evaluator with its batched coefficient field to present a single callable <computeroutput>double operator()(IdxBatch, CoordRTheta)</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allows the <formula id="159">$ \alpha $</formula> and <formula id="160">$ \beta $</formula> coefficients to be passed to <computeroutput><ref refid="classPolarSplineFEMPoissonLikeAssembler" kindref="compound">PolarSplineFEMPoissonLikeAssembler</ref></computeroutput>, which expects a generic, batch-index-aware callable.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Evaluator</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the 2D evaluator. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Coeff</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the batched spline coefficient field. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
